  Archaelogists and Barbarians that are going to twoweapon may not want
to waste skill slots advancing their primary and secondary weapon skills
past Basic, since they're limited to Basic in #twoweapon skill.  Ditto
for Tourists, Valkyries, and Knights at skilled.  

  Samurai can get to Expert, but getting #twoweapon, primary and
secondary weapons all to Expert can take up to 18 skill slots.  That's
not counting any spell skill slots.

  Rogues shouldn't #twoweapon so they can get the backstab bonus.  Also,
Rogues throwing Expert daggers 2.5 weapon and at range while being able
to wear a shield, use 1/2 to 1/3 as many skill slots and 1/2 as many
blessed scrolls of Enchant Weapon.


